{"title": "Gnome Cunning", "pageid": 3961, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gnome_Cunning", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome_Cunning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Gnome_Cunning.webp/300px-Gnome_Cunning.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Gnome_Cunning.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Gnome_Cunning.webp/300px-Gnome_Cunning.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Gnome_Cunning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Gnome Cunning</b> is a passive feature that grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. It is available to all <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnome</a> characters.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnome</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baff_Elkhorn\" title=\"Baff Elkhorn\">Baff Elkhorn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bala_Ofran\" title=\"Bala Ofran\">Bala Ofran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Battrick_Degronce\" title=\"Battrick Degronce\">Battrick Degronce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bearclaw\" title=\"Bearclaw\">Bearclaw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beldron\" title=\"Beldron\">Beldron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brounce\" title=\"Brounce\">Brounce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\">Bumpnagel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Caralee_Grollo\" title=\"Caralee Grollo\">Caralee Grollo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Carys\" title=\"Carys\">Carys</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Civilian_(Gnome,_Iron_Throne)\" title=\"Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)\">Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Deedle_Ofran\" title=\"Deedle Ofran\">Deedle Ofran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Devella_Fountainhead\" title=\"Devella Fountainhead\">Devella Fountainhead</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dez_Kanshaw\" title=\"Dez Kanshaw\">Dez Kanshaw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dilgar_Sneese\" title=\"Dilgar Sneese\">Dilgar Sneese</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dimples_Backster\" title=\"Dimples Backster\">Dimples Backster</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Donna_Blague\" title=\"Donna Blague\">Donna Blague</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dringo\" title=\"Dringo\">Dringo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Droo_Falbo\" title=\"Droo Falbo\">Droo Falbo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dubos_Clodds\" title=\"Dubos Clodds\">Dubos Clodds</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dulbers_Frint\" title=\"Dulbers Frint\">Dulbers Frint</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edenosa\" title=\"Edenosa\">Edenosa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ellswort\" title=\"Ellswort\">Ellswort</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Essius\" title=\"Essius\">Essius</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Farlin\" title=\"Farlin\">Farlin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Featherweight_Falson\" title=\"Featherw